ISSUE TITLE: Gemini error iin claude code
ISSUE DESCRIPTION:
I downloaded repo,
clone it. 
npm install,
run project, 
login. 
add gemini keys.
test in playground, Working. 
install claude code. with npx freellmapi setup-claude --url http://localhost:3001
added the unified-key. 
then run claude 
and say "HI" to claude and got error.

⏺ API Error: 400 All routed providers rejected the request as invalid. Attempt trail: google/gemini-3.5-flash key1: provider_bad_request; google/gemini-3.7-flash key1: provider_bad_request; google/gemini-3.6-flash key1: provider_bad_request; google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite key1: provider_bad_request; google/gemini-2.5-flash key1: provider_bad_request; google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite key1: provider_bad_request; google/gemini-3-flash-preview key1: provider_bad_request; google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite key1: provider_bad_request. Last error: Google API error 400: * GenerateContentRequest.tools[0].function_declarations[3].parameters.properties[query].properties[where].items.items: missing field.

what i am missing? Please help. 

